  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Impact evaluation of New Alliance for Food Security and Nutrition  is a component of Pilot support to the Grow Africa partnership to enhance responsible investment and inclusive agriculture growth in Africa reported by FCDO with a funding type of 104 - Procurement of Services and a budget of &#xA3;118,880. This project benefits Africa, regional. It works in the following sector(s): Agricultural policy and administrative management, Business policy and administration.</narrative>
